msgid "- [button](/api/css/button.md) — The general-purpose action button."
msgstr "- [button](/fr/api/css/button.md) — The general-purpose action button."

#: css/color.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: color"
msgstr "# CSS: color"

#: css/color.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--text-danger` — Semantic colour utilities: `.--bg-<name>`, `.--text-<name>` (aliased as `.--color-<name>`), and `.--border-<name>` for the curated semantic palette. Every one of these also has a component-attached alias modifier (for example `-bg-danger` on any `.instui-<component>`)."
msgstr "`.--text-danger` — Semantic colour utilities: `.--bg-&lt;name&gt;`, `.--text-&lt;name&gt;` (aliased as `.--color-&lt;name&gt;`), and `.--border-&lt;name&gt;` for the curated semantic palette. Every one of these also has a component-attached alias modifier (for example `-bg-danger` on any `.instui-&lt;component&gt;`)."

#: css/color.md
