#: css/mask.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: mask"
msgstr "# CSS: mask"

#: css/mask.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-mask` — An in-flow overlay that fills its positioned parent and centres its content — e.g. a spinner over a card. For a modal, prefer a native `<dialog>` (its `::backdrop` is the mask). Every one of these modifiers is also available globally (bare, or chained onto any other component) — see the `mask` global utility."
msgstr "`.instui-mask` — An in-flow overlay that fills its positioned parent and centres its content — e.g. a spinner over a card. For a modal, prefer a native `&lt;dialog&gt;` (its `::backdrop` is the mask). Every one of these modifiers is also available globally (bare, or chained onto any other component) — see the `mask` global utility."

#: css/mask.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [mask.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/mask/mask.css)"
msgstr "**Source:** [mask.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/mask/mask.css)"

#: css/mask.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Blur what's behind the mask with a backdrop-filter."
msgstr "Floutez ce qui se trouve derrière le masque avec un backdrop-filter."

#: css/mask.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Fixed to the viewport, covering it at a high z-index."
msgstr "Fixé à la fenêtre d'affichage, couvrant celle-ci avec un z-index élevé."

#: css/maskglobal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: maskglobal"
msgstr "# CSS: maskglobal"

#: css/maskglobal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.--mask-overlay` — A global, dual copy of the `mask` component's overlay modifiers — `--mask-overlay`, `--mask-fullscreen`, `--mask-blur` — usable bare or chained onto any component, without wrapping in a `.instui-mask` element."
msgstr "`.--mask-overlay` — Une copie globale en double des modificateurs d'overlay du composant `mask` — `--mask-overlay`, `--mask-fullscreen`, `--mask-blur` — utilisable seule ou chaînée à n'importe quel composant, sans envelopper dans un élément `.instui-mask`."

#: css/maskglobal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/mask/index.ts)"
msgstr "**Source :** [index.ts](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/utilities/mask/index.ts)"

#: css/maskglobal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The full mask overlay (position, centring, background)."
msgstr "La superposition de masque complète (position, centrage, arrière-plan)."

#: css/menu.group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: menu.group"
msgstr "# CSS: menu.group"

#: css/menu.group.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.group` — A labelled group heading (InstUI `Menu.Group`/`Menu.ItemGroup`)."
msgstr "`.group` — Un en-tête de groupe libellé (InstUI `Menu.Group`/`Menu.ItemGroup`)."

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: menu.item"
msgstr "# CSS: menu.item"

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.item` — A menu entry (InstUI `Menu.Item`); add -disabled, -highlighted, or -active/[aria-checked]."
msgstr "`.item` — Une entrée de menu (InstUI `Menu.Item`) ; ajouter -disabled, -highlighted ou -active/[aria-checked]."

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Mark a checked item with `aria-checked=\"true\"` (same styling as `-active`)."
msgstr "Marquer un élément coché avec `aria-checked=\"true\"` (même style que `-active`)."

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Active/checked highlight; same styling as `[aria-checked=\"true\"]`."
msgstr "Surlignement actif/coché ; même style que `[aria-checked=\"true\"]`."

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Muted, non-interactive."
msgstr "Atténué, non interactif."

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Highlighted background/text (keyboard focus or hover)."
msgstr "Arrière-plan/texte surligné (focus clavier ou survol)."

#: css/menu.item.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Secondary info text within the item."
msgstr "Texte d'information secondaire à l'intérieur de l'élément."

#: css/menu.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: menu"
msgstr "# CSS: menu"

#: css/menu.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-menu` — A dropdown surface of items, groups, and separators."
msgstr "`.instui-menu` — Une surface déroulante d'éléments, de groupes et de séparateurs."

#: css/menu.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Compose entries as `.item` (see the `menu.item` member), label a section with `.group` (see `menu.group`), and divide sections with `.separator` (see `menu.separator`)."
msgstr "Composez les entrées en tant que `.item` (voir le membre `menu.item`), étiquetez une section avec `.group` (voir `menu.group`), et divisez les sections avec `.separator` (voir `menu.separator`)."

#: css/menu.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/menu/members/group/group.css)"
msgstr "**Source :** [group.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/menu/members/group/group.css)"

#: css/menu.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [tree-browser](/api/css/tree-browser.md) — Both present nested, selectable entries.\n- [simple-select](/api/css/simple-select.md) — A select's dropdown reuses this menu surface."
msgstr "- [tree-browser](/fr/api/css/tree-browser.md) — Both present nested, selectable entries.\n- [simple-select](/fr/api/css/simple-select.md) — A select's dropdown reuses this menu surface."

#: css/menu.separator.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: menu.separator"
msgstr "# CSS: menu.separator"

#: css/menu.separator.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.separator` — A divider rule between items (InstUI `Menu.Separator`)."
msgstr "`.separator` — Une règle de séparation entre les éléments (InstUI `Menu.Separator`)."

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: metric"
msgstr "# CSS: metric"

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-metric` — A labelled statistic — a large value over a caption."
msgstr "`.instui-metric` — Une statistique étiquetée — une grande valeur au-dessus d'une légende."

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sets its own `gap` between the value and label, and its own horizontal `padding`; chaining a `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` spacing utility modifier overrides those built-in values."
msgstr "Définit son propre `gap` entre la valeur et le libellé, et son propre `padding` horizontal ; chaîner un modificateur d'utilitaire d'espacement `-gap-*`/`-p-*`/`-padding-*` remplace ces valeurs intégrées."

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [metric.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/metric/metric.css)"
msgstr "**Source :** [metric.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/metric/metric.css)"

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Centre the value and label."
msgstr "Centrer la valeur et le libellé."

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "End-align the value and label."
msgstr "Aligner la valeur et le libellé sur la fin."

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Start-align the value and label."
msgstr "Aligner la valeur et le libellé sur le début."

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The caption beneath the value."
msgstr "La légende sous la valeur."

#: css/metric.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The large metric number."
msgstr "Le grand nombre métrique."

#: css/modal.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: modal.body"
msgstr "# CSS: modal.body"

#: css/modal.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.body` — The content region (InstUI `Modal.Body`); a lone `<img>` goes full-bleed."
msgstr "`.body` — The content region (InstUI `Modal.Body`); a lone `&lt;img&gt;` goes full-bleed."

#: css/modal.body.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `modal`'s `-overflow-fit`, `-density-compact`, and `-color-inverse` modifiers restyle this member — see `modal`'s own doc for those modifiers."
msgstr "Les modificateurs `-overflow-fit`, `-density-compact` et `-color-inverse` du parent `modal` restylent ce membre — voir la documentation propre de `modal` pour ces modificateurs."

#: css/modal.footer.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: modal.footer"
msgstr "# CSS: modal.footer"

#: css/modal.footer.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.footer` — The actions row (InstUI `Modal.Footer`)."
msgstr "`.footer` — La ligne d'actions (InstUI `Modal.Footer`)."

#: css/modal.footer.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The parent `modal`'s `-density-compact` and `-color-inverse` modifiers restyle this member — see `modal`'s own doc for those modifiers."
msgstr "Les modificateurs `-density-compact` et `-color-inverse` du parent `modal` restylent ce membre — voir la documentation propre de `modal` pour ces modificateurs."

#: css/modal.header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: modal.header"
msgstr "# CSS: modal.header"

#: css/modal.header.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.header` — The title row (InstUI `Modal.Header`)."
msgstr "`.header` — La ligne de titre (InstUI `Modal.Header`)."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: modal"
msgstr "# CSS: modal"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-modal` — A dialog surface (works on a native &lt;dialog&gt;); header/body/footer parts."
msgstr "`.instui-modal` — Une surface de dialogue (fonctionne sur un &lt;dialog&gt; natif) ; parties header/body/footer."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "See the `modal.header`, `modal.body`, and `modal.footer` members for the individual parts."
msgstr "Voir les membres `modal.header`, `modal.body` et `modal.footer` pour les parties individuelles."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [body.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/modal/members/body/body.css)"
msgstr "**Source :** [body.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/modal/members/body/body.css)"

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Open the native `<dialog>` with `showModal()` for modal semantics and Esc-to-close, and name it with `aria-labelledby` pointing at the `.header`."
msgstr "Open the native `&lt;dialog&gt;` with `showModal()` for modal semantics and Esc-to-close, and name it with `aria-labelledby` pointing at the `.header`."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Blur the backdrop behind the modal."
msgstr "Flouter l'arrière-plan derrière la modale."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "On-dark chrome (pairs with a media body). @affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — Recolours each part for the on-dark look."
msgstr "Chrome sur fond sombre (s'associe à un media body). @affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — Recolorise chaque partie pour l'apparence sur fond sombre."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Tighter part padding. @affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — Tightens each part's padding."
msgstr "Padding des parties plus serré. @affects modal.header @affects modal.body @affects modal.footer — Réduit le padding de chaque partie."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Constrain to the viewport and scroll the body. @affects modal.body — Scrolls the body when the modal is capped to the viewport."
msgstr "Contraint à la fenêtre d'affichage et fait défiler le corps. @affects modal.body — Fait défiler le corps lorsque la modale est limitée à la fenêtre."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Sized to content."
msgstr "Dimensionné au contenu."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Edge-to-edge."
msgstr "Bord à bord."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A wide modal. Long-form alias of `-size-lg`."
msgstr "Une modale large. Alias longue de `-size-lg`."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A wide modal."
msgstr "Une modale large."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A narrow modal."
msgstr "Une modale étroite."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "A narrow modal. Long-form alias of `-size-sm`."
msgstr "Une modale étroite. Alias longue de `-size-sm`."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Dims the page behind the dialog as its mask, and frosts it under `-blur`."
msgstr "Assombrit la page derrière le dialogue comme masque, et lui applique un effet givré sous `-blur`."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- Styles a native &lt;dialog&gt; and its `::backdrop`; the top-layer rendering and backdrop styling need a browser that supports the dialog element."
msgstr "- Stylise un &lt;dialog&gt; natif et son `::backdrop` ; le rendu en couche supérieure et le style du fond nécessitent un navigateur qui prend en charge l'élément dialog."

#: css/modal.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [tray](/api/css/tray.md) — A tray is the same dismissible overlay pattern, anchored to a screen edge."
msgstr "- [tray](/fr/api/css/tray.md) — A tray is the same dismissible overlay pattern, anchored to a screen edge."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: number-input"
msgstr "# CSS: number-input"

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`.instui-number-input` — A number-input facade with a +/- spinner column."
msgstr "`.instui-number-input` — Une façade de champ numérique avec une colonne de sélection +/-."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The `.arrows` buttons are `aria-hidden` and purely presentational — incrementing/decrementing the value on click is the consumer's JS to wire up."
msgstr "Les boutons `.arrows` sont `aria-hidden` et purement de présentation — l'incrémentation/décrémentation de la valeur au clic doit être implémentée par le JS du consommateur."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "**Source:** [number-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/number-input/number-input.css)"
msgstr "**Source :** [number-input.css](https://github.com/thedannywahl/pantoken/blob/main/formats/components/src/components/number-input/number-input.css)"

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Put the accessible name on the `<input>` (e.g. `aria-label`) so the field owns the value; the +/- spinner buttons are decorative and marked `aria-hidden=\"true\"`."
msgstr "Put the accessible name on the `&lt;input&gt;` (e.g. `aria-label`) so the field owns the value; the +/- spinner buttons are decorative and marked `aria-hidden=\"true\"`."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) Medium."
msgstr "(par défaut) Moyen."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "(default) Medium. Long-form alias of `-size-md`."
msgstr "(par défaut) Moyen. Alias longue forme de `-size-md`."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The +/- spinner column at the inline-end."
msgstr "La colonne de sélection +/- à l'inline-end."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The decrement button; the unclassed button increments."
msgstr "Le bouton de décrémentation ; le bouton sans classe incrémente."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "The masked chevron glyph on each spinner button: up to increment, down on `.down`."
msgstr "Le glyphe chevron masqué sur chaque bouton de sélection : vers le haut pour incrémenter, vers le bas sur `.down`."

#: css/number-input.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "- [text-input](/api/css/text-input.md) — Shares the same input facade chrome.\n- [range-input](/api/css/range-input.md) — Another numeric input control."
msgstr "- [text-input](/fr/api/css/text-input.md) — Shares the same input facade chrome.\n- [range-input](/fr/api/css/range-input.md) — Another numeric input control."

#: css/overflow.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:text"
msgid "# CSS: overflow"
msgstr "# CSS: overflow"

#: css/overflow.md
#, no-c-format
