#: platforms/android/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "`@pantoken/android` — emit Instructure design tokens as Android resource XML."
msgstr "`@pantoken/android` — émettre les design tokens Instructure au format XML des ressources Android."

#: platforms/android/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "It flattens the IR to concrete, single-mode values (`@pantoken/core`'s `toStyleDictionary`), then\nemits `res/values/colors.xml` (colour tokens) and `res/values/dimens.xml` (dimension tokens) via\n`@pantoken/sd-config`. Style Dictionary applies the Android transforms (`#aarrggbb`, `dp`/`sp`)."
msgstr "Il aplatit l'IR en valeurs concrètes à mode unique (`@pantoken/core`'s `toStyleDictionary`), puis\német `res/values/colors.xml` (jetons de couleur) et `res/values/dimens.xml` (jetons de dimension) via\n`@pantoken/sd-config`. Style Dictionary applique les transformations Android (`#aarrggbb`, `dp`/`sp`)."

#: platforms/android/src/index.md
#, no-c-format
msgctxt "docs.api:prose"
msgid "Renames and re-exports [generateAndroid](functions/generateAndroid.md)"
msgstr "Renomme et réexporte [generateAndroid](functions/generateAndroid.md)"

